<!-- THE LAUNCHER ICON (the manifest's android:icon; the launcher and the
     recents card). Its picture (architect 2026-10-23: "the new note glyph
     on the caption's color"): THE QUAVER, the caption's own icon,
     assets/icons/AppIcon.svg (a symlink to Quaver.svg, bone F0F0F0 on a
     34 x 40 viewBox), rendered by resvg at the art's height and centered
     over THE CAPTION'S GROUND, FLAT: #141415 (render.h's kCaptionGround),
     one color over the whole canvas, so the mask shows the caption's dark
     shape carrying the note. An
     ADAPTIVE icon, the whole of it: minSdk is 30, so
     no legacy ic_launcher.png set exists beside it.

     Two layers per density under res/mipmap-<density>/, BOTH RENDERED AT
     EVERY BUILD by apk/build_apk.sh's launcher step into its staged
     copy of res/ (the Linux desktop icon is the same drawing bare, a link
     into the repository, docs/INSTALL.md):
       ic_launcher_background.png  the full 108 dp canvas flat in #141415;
       ic_launcher_foreground.png  the drawing rendered 52 dp tall, its width
                                   the viewBox's (44.2 dp for the quaver),
                                   centred on a transparent canvas of the
                                   density's full 108 dp.

     THE 66 dp SAFE ZONE: an adaptive foreground's art should sit inside the
     mask's guaranteed-visible inner circle, Android's own 66 dp of the 108 dp
     canvas. The art 52 dp tall (architect 2026-10-16, his pick off a 60 /
     56 / 52 / 48 / 44 / 40 dp series on the glass: at 64 dp the art filled
     ~86 % of the launcher's visible tile and nearly touched its corners):
     the quaver's 40-unit viewBox at 1.3 dp a unit, 44.2 x 52 dp. Its
     farthest ink (the head's lower left) lies 16.5 units, 21.4 dp, from the
     viewBox's center, inside the 33 dp circle with 11.6 dp to spare. The
     same 52 dp at every density (the per-density PNG pixel size scales with
     the density factor f alone; the quaver's width 45 / 67 / 89 / 133 /
     177 px, resvg rounding up):

       density  f    canvas C=108f  art 52f  offset (C-52f)/2
       mdpi     1    108            52       28
       hdpi     1.5  162            78       42
       xhdpi    2    216            104      56
       xxhdpi   3    324            156      84
       xxxhdpi  4    432            208      112

     A BUILD PRODUCT, NEVER COMMITTED: this file is the one tracked file of
     res/, and build_apk.sh writes the PNGs beside it in the package tree
     (byte-stable, -strip) from assets/icons/AppIcon.svg, the quaver, at
     the build. The safe-zone figure above is the quaver's. -->
<adaptive-icon xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
    <background android:drawable="@mipmap/ic_launcher_background"/>
    <foreground android:drawable="@mipmap/ic_launcher_foreground"/>
</adaptive-icon>
